| **{{meta:fwd_label}}** | {{fwd}}. [Table {{ref:tab:A-all}}, Appendix {{app:Records}}] |
| **Speed requirement** (pre-registered, stamp lag {{cv.pre.lag}} s) | Break-even feed delay **{{cv.pre.be.range}} s** ({{cv.pre.be.is}} s IS, {{cv.pre.be.oos}} s OOS; {{sc.pre.oos.v1.usd}}/day OOS at 1 s): the call must reach the venue **{{cv.call_before_stamp}} s before the umpire's stamp**. [Table {{ref:tab:head}}, Eq. {{ref:eq:budget}}] |
| Measured latency | The book reprices {{lat.book_vs_stamp}} s *before* the official point stamp (n = {{lat.n_points}}); ESPN, Polymarket's sports feed and the WTA API trail the book by {{lat.espn}}, {{lat.pmsports}} and {{lat.wta}} s. [Fig. {{ref:fig:race}}a] |
| **Pipeline** (paper; order built, not sent) | Frame to unsigned order **{{e2e.ours}} ms** p50 ({{e2e.n}} traces, own footage over WebRTC into the CV engine on a laptop). With a simulated 1 s feed, {{e2e.net}} ms network and the venue's 1 s hold the order is executable at **{{e2e.total}} ms**, under the organisers' {{e2e.req}} ms bar. [Fig. {{ref:fig:f2t}}] |
